OL,3,GNEWSACompanies fined #145k after worker
OL,4,Akilled at construction site
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo companies were issued with fines
OL,7,Ftotalling #145,000 on Friday following
OL,8,Fa fatality at a County Antrim aqueduct.
OL,10,FFather-of-two John Traynor, 41, who
OL,11,Fworked for IJ Lynn & Sons, was fatally
OL,12,Finjured on Knockagh Road in January
OL,13,F2022.
OL,15,FThe Ballycastle man died when the
OL,16,Fforward-tipping dumper truck he was
OL,17,Fdriving overturned.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
