OL,3,GNEWSACompanies fined #145k after worker
OL,4,Akilled at construction site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two companies, IJ Lynn & Sons Ltd,
OL,7,Fof Glenshesk Road, Ballymoney, and John
OL,8,FGraham Construction Ltd, of Ballygowan
OL,9,FRoad, Hillsborough, admitted health and
OL,10,Fsafety breaches and were issued with
OL,11,Ffines by Judge Gordon Kerr KC at
OL,12,FBelfast Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
